### UStudent API - Complete Test Workflows
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### === WORKFLOW 1: Student Course Selection Flow ===

### 1. Login as student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_student"
}

### 2. View available courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses?studentId=1

### 3. Check student profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/profile

### 4. Check CS101 eligibility (should be eligible)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/eligibility?studentId=1

### 5. Enroll in CS101
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/enroll?studentId=1

### 6. Check current schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/schedule

### 7. Check CS201 eligibility (should now meet prerequisite)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/eligibility?studentId=1

### 8. Enroll in CS201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/enroll?studentId=1

### 9. Check final enrolled courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me/courses?studentId=1

### === WORKFLOW 2: Conflict Detection Test ===

### 1. Enroll in MATH101 (MWF 9:30-11:00)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/3/enroll?studentId=2

### 2. Check current schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/schedule

### 3. Check CS101 conflicts (should conflict - MWF 9:00-10:30 vs 9:30-11:00)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/conflicts?studentId=2

### 4. Try to enroll in CS101 (should fail due to conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/enroll?studentId=2

### 5. Check CS201 conflicts (TTh - should be fine)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/conflicts?studentId=2

### === WORKFLOW 3: Prerequisites Enforcement ===

### 1. Check CS201 eligibility for Student 2 (should fail multiple requirements)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/eligibility?studentId=2

### 2. Try to enroll in CS201 (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/enroll?studentId=2

### 3. Check what Student 2 needs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/profile

### === WORKFLOW 4: Drop Course Test ===

### 1. Check current enrollments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me/courses?studentId=1

### 2. Drop a course
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/drop?studentId=1

### 3. Verify course was dropped
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me/courses?studentId=1

### 4. Check updated schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/schedule